# Prevent accidental secrets, builds, and local test data in the public source repo.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/Pods/
**/DerivedData/
**/.runtime/
**/private-attachments/
**/key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.mobileprovision
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/google-services.json
